'''Naganadel''' (Japanese: '''アーゴヨン''' ''Agoyon'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

