==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Naganadel|108}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*The '''Electro House''' attack is named after {{wp|electro house}}, a genre of music. In the Japanese version of this card, the attack is named アシッドハウス ''{{wp|Acid House}}'', which may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Naganadel}}'s {{t|Poison}} typing in the [[core series games]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

